Expose the standard-library notice already present in the pinned Rust
compiler archive. rules_rs 0.1.3 downloads this file but does not export
it. Remove this patch when its compiler repository exposes the notice.

https://github.com/hermeticbuild/rules_rs/blob/7065a72736844e3f7358431d8b2299ec35674d61/rs/private/rustc_repository.bzl

--- a/rs/private/rustc_repository.bzl
